flowchart TB
Database[Product database] --> Backup[Authorized encrypted scoped backup]
Backup --> Retain[Approved retention and private backup storage]
Retain --> Isolated[Restore into isolated disposable target]
Isolated --> Verify[Schema revision checksums counts ownership and app smoke]
Files[Private object storage] --> Manifest[Object checksums and metadata consistency]
Manifest --> Verify
Robot[Robot journal] --> Safe[Consistent journal snapshot and stopped restored state]
Safe --> Verify
Verify --> Evidence[Private restore evidence]
Deploy[Bad release] --> Stop[Contain writes and stop unsafe processing]
Stop --> Rollback[Previous qualified artifacts with schema compatibility checks]
Rollback --> Post[Hosted post-rollback tests]
Gate[No destructive restore over production without separate approval] --> Isolated
